    "/apis/v1/fantasydata-com/fantasy-sports-rankings/rankings": {
      "post": {
        "description": "This week's start/sit order or projected points for a position from FantasyData, for example half-PPR running backs or the kicker ranking.\n\n<!-- aisa-pricing:start -->\n按用量计费；默认请求预估费用：$0.0005 USD（不是固定价格）。 最终费用以账户适用价格及实际结算为准。\n<!-- aisa-pricing:end -->",
